    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Window Aquarista is a chill idle game about building and keeping your own aquariums. All while focusing on other tasks as the game sits on the bottom of your screen!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/cdc743e41f44ff6c0e52731fa6c4eba6.webp?t=1755712463\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/908b8f8a2b722a79685e4cc9ce277561.poster.avif?t=1755712463\" width=512 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/908b8f8a2b722a79685e4cc9ce277561.webm?t=1755712463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hatch fish from eggs.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fish will lay eggs that will hatch after a certain time. Be patient with them!\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your fish grow while you do other things.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatching them is only the beginning of their journey.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock over 60 different types of fish!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new fish while afk!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell your fish to build your fortune.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch them, raise them, sell them, repeat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/fdfbe49c42e3ae8913dbf798d397757c.webp?t=1755712463\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/a7565093a2bcaead65cae7dbad6d0c26.poster.avif?t=1755712463\" width=512 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/a7565093a2bcaead65cae7dbad6d0c26.webm?t=1755712463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep your fish fed to keep them happy!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your fish from time to time or they will go lethargic.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try different foods for different effects!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spice up their diet to break the monotony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/b563c2bc78bebe666c46f812b91c2d24.webp?t=1755712463\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/5a4e9b4e237d0b34f72659bbd416dec3.poster.avif?t=1755712463\" width=512 height=269 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/5a4e9b4e237d0b34f72659bbd416dec3.webm?t=1755712463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep it clean!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Algae may take over an unwatched tank, but you have the tools to restore it to its full glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/8ff2cd03851779408b79db700547ebd8.webp?t=1755712463\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/eb9e0dbbd525503ce6d88cd2ea470b1d.poster.avif?t=1755712463\" width=512 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/eb9e0dbbd525503ce6d88cd2ea470b1d.webm?t=1755712463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take a look at the ever growing catalogue of decorations and create your dream aquarium.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thematic tanks? Feeling original? The options are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/03243809bdcc69eaed63f43a51e5ff6e.webp?t=1755712463\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game sits at the bottom of your screen, in a non-intrusive manner.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, watch, play, or do whatever you want while your fish live in the bottom of your screen!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi task without interferences.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something requires your full attention? No problem, quickly set the game out of view, while still running!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/67c0a4f411aa5838ebac173c9b4e8aad.poster.avif?t=1755712463\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/67c0a4f411aa5838ebac173c9b4e8aad.webm?t=1755712463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/67c0a4f411aa5838ebac173c9b4e8aad.mp4?t=1755712463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
