t the game out of view, while still running!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/67c0a4f411aa5838ebac173c9b4e8aad.poster.avif?t=1755712463\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/67c0a4f411aa5838ebac173c9b4e8aad.webm?t=1755712463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/67c0a4f411aa5838ebac173c9b4e8aad.mp4?t=1755712463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
